"<div>\n<i class=\"NoteType\">\nPerson Note\n</i>\n<div class=\"grampsstylednote\">\n<p>\nObituary states: \"Mrs Cowell was always ready and willing to help in sickness and trouble. She was baptized in the Methodist church when a young woman and remained in that faith until death. Grandma Cowell was bedfast almost 5 years and was a patient sufferer all that time. She will be missed by her family, relatives and friends.\"\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>",
